Source: wireview-hwmon
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Emanuele Sparvoli <sparvoli@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper (>= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2

Package: wireview-hwmon-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: dkms, ${misc:Depends}
Description: WireView Pro II hwmon kernel module (DKMS)
 Linux hwmon kernel module for the Thermal Grizzly WireView Pro II
 GPU power monitor. Exposes voltage, current, power, and temperature
 sensor data through /sys/class/hwmon/.
 .
 This package uses DKMS to automatically rebuild the module
 when the kernel is updated.

Package: wireview-hwmon
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: wireview-hwmon-dkms, dfu-util
Description: WireView Pro II daemon and CLI tool
 Userspace daemon and CLI tool for the Thermal Grizzly WireView Pro II
 GPU power monitor. The daemon reads the device over USB serial and
 feeds sensor data to the wireview_hwmon kernel module.
 .
 Includes wireviewd (daemon), wireviewctl (CLI tool), systemd service,
 and udev rules.
